Section "Screen"
    Identifier  "Screen 1"
    Device      "Banshee"
    Monitor     "Digital PCXAV-WZ"
    DefaultDepth 16

    Subsection "Display"
        Depth       16
        Modes       "1600x1200"
        ViewPort    0 0
    EndSubsection
EndSection

I think if you just add the 'Modes' line with your desired resolution,
you should be fine (assuming your card & monitor support that mode).

Cheers,

Paul 'WEiRD' de Weerd

